	DetalleInicial: The world has {0} tiles.
	BuscarAyuda: The search is spread across frames: you can keep playing while it runs.
	DetalleEnMarcha: "{0} found so far, {1} tiles checked."
	DetalleTerminada: "{0} tiles found out of {1} checked, in {2} ms of CPU {3}"
	AmbitoExplorado: (explored area only).
	AmbitoTodo: (across the whole world).
	CategoriaVacia: Nothing from this category exists in this game.
	AyudaCofres: Walks Main.chest: every chest and dresser in the world, with what is inside.
	AyudaNpcs: Walks Main.npc: the NPCs alive right now, with their real health.
	AyudaLiquido: Looks for this liquid in each tile's liquid data.
	AyudaPared: Wall types: {0}
	AyudaTile: Tile types: {0}
	SinResultados: There is not a single one in the world (or not in what you have explored).
	AquiSaldran: The places where what you look for is will show up here.
