	}

	Dificultad: {
		SinMundo: No world is loaded.
		Multijugador: You are in a multiplayer game: the world mode is up to the server.
		YaEnEseModo: The world is already in this mode.
		ModoInexistente: This game mode does not exist in this version of the game.
		SinPersonaje: No character is loaded.
		SoloViaje: Your character is a Journey one and can only enter Journey worlds: if you take Journey mode off this world, this character will be locked out.
		NoViaje: Your character is NOT a Journey one: if you put this world into Journey mode, this character will not be able to come back in.
		PermanenteAutoguardado: The change is PERMANENT: it is written to the world on the next autosave (which you have on).
		PermanenteAlGuardar: The change is PERMANENT: it is written to the world as soon as it saves (autosave is off, but leaving to the menu saves anyway).
		Efecto: Enemies that already spawned keep their health and damage until they respawn; loot does react right away.
	}
}

